{"book":"2kings","num":6,"verses":[{"en":"And the sons of the prophets said unto Elisha, Behold now, the place where we dwell with thee is too strait for us.","n":1,"sm":"Suria Ua fai mai soo o le au perofeta ia Elisaia, Faauta mai, o le mea tatou te mau ai nei ma oe, ua fetinai ai tatou.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Suria"},{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"soo"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"perofeta"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"Elisaia,"},{"en":"","sm":"Faauta"},{"en":"","sm":"mai,"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"tatou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"mau"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"nei"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"oe,"},{"en":"","sm":"ua"},{"en":"","sm":"fetinai"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"tatou."}]},{"en":"Let us go, we pray thee, unto Jordan, and take thence every man a beam, and let us make us a place there, where we may dwell. And he answered, Go ye.","n":2,"sm":"Seʻi matou O ia i Ioritana, ma taitasi le tagata ma ave ai lana laau, matou te fai aʻi i lea mea se fale tatou te mau ai. Ona tali atu ai lea o ia, Ina o ia.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Seʻi"},{"en":"","sm":"matou"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"ia"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"Ioritana,"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"taitasi"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tagata"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ave"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lana"},{"en":"","sm":"laau,"},{"en":"","sm":"matou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"aʻi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"mea"},{"en":"","sm":"se"},{"en":"","sm":"fale"},{"en":"","sm":"tatou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"mau"},{"en":"","sm":"ai."},{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"tali"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"Ina"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia."}]},{"en":"And one said, Be content, I pray thee, and go with thy servants. And he answered, I will go.","n":3,"sm":"Ona fai mai lea o le tasi, Seʻi tatou O ma i matou O au auauna. Ona fai atu lea o ia, Tatou te o lava.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"mai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tasi,"},{"en":"","sm":"Seʻi"},{"en":"","sm":"tatou"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"matou"},{"en":"","sm":"O"},{"en":"","sm":"au"},{"en":"","sm":"auauna."},{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"fai"},{"en":"","sm":"atu"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ia,"},{"en":"","sm":"Tatou"},{"en":"","sm":"te"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"lava."}]},{"en":"So he went with them. And when they came to Jordan, they cut down wood.","n":4,"sm":"Ona latou o ai lea ma ia. Ua oo foi i latou i Ioritana, ona latou ta laau ai lea.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ona"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"ma"},{"en":"","sm":"ia."},{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"oo"},{"en":"","sm":"foi"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"Ioritana,"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"latou"},{"en":"","sm":"ta"},{"en":"","sm":"laau"},{"en":"","sm":"ai"},{"en":"","sm":"lea."}]},{"en":"But as one was felling a beam, the axe head fell into the water: and he cried, and said, Alas, master! for it was borrowed.","n":5,"sm":"Ua ta e le tasi le laau, ona paŭ ese lea o le matau i le vai; ona alaga lea o ia, ua faapea mai, Aue! le alii e; auā o le mea non6.","w":[{"en":"","sm":"Ua"},{"en":"","sm":"ta"},{"en":"","sm":"e"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"tasi"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"laau,"},{"en":"","sm":"ona"},{"en":"","sm":"paŭ"},{"en":"","sm":"ese"},{"en":"","sm":"lea"},{"en":"","sm":"o"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},{"en":"","sm":"matau"},{"en":"","sm":"i"},{"en":"","sm":"le"},